# Archwright core packages, milestone 1 (base system only, no desktop).
# One package per line. '#' starts a comment. '## Group:' headers are
# parsed by the guide drift check and ignored by the installer.

## Group: base
base
base-devel
linux
linux-firmware
linux-headers

## Group: microcode
amd-ucode
intel-ucode

## Group: filesystem
btrfs-progs
dosfstools
exfatprogs
snapper

## Group: boot
efibootmgr
limine
mkinitcpio
plymouth

## Group: network
networkmanager
openssh

## Group: cli-staples
bash-completion
git
less
man-db
nano
ripgrep
sudo
vim

## Group: hardware
sof-firmware
zram-generator
